      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You want some flavor for your city, so here are a few archetypes. There's the slick, nervous hustler, always looking over his shoulder, probably running numbers for a bigger player. Then you've got the muscle, a big, silent brute who just exists to intimidate, usually smelling of cheap whiskey and stale smoke. Don't forget the local fixture, the wise-cracking old-timer who knows every dirty secret in the district. Finally, there's the desperate kid, too young for the grime but already drowning in it, always looking for a way out that never comes.",
